                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It's that time of the year when Congress must pass a bill to fund the government.\n\nRepublicans hold a trifecta in the government (they control the House, Senate, and White House), so this is on them.\n\nLet me be clear: Democrats will NOT help them take away health care.",
