                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We will NOT support a partisan Republican spending bill that rips away health care from the American people.\n\nRepublicans have launched the largest assault on health care in our country's history. How so? Let me explain.",
