                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\u2757\ufe0fRepublicans took Medicaid away from millions of Americans.\n\n\u2757\ufe0fThey forced hospitals, nursing homes, and health clinics to close.\n\n\u2757\ufe0fThey did not extend ACA tax credits, so premiums, co-pays, and deductibles will go up for at least 20M people.",
