                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "But wait, there's more.\n\n\u2757\ufe0f$536 billion will be cut from Medicare if Republicans do not act this year.\n\n\u2757\ufe0fThey've cut funding for\u00a0 the CDC, NIH, vaccines, and medical research. People are going to die.\n\nOnce again, Democrats will NOT help them take away health care.",
